/**
 * @file groups.dox
 * Doxygen group definitions for the SimuCell3D C++ API reference.
 *
 * Each header in include/ assigns its file and classes to one of these groups
 * with @ingroup. The groups match the pages under doc/api/.
 */

/** @defgroup core Solver and configuration
 *  The solver, its main loop, compile-time configuration, parameter structures and exceptions.
 */

/** @defgroup io Input and output
 *  Parameter file and input mesh readers, simulation initializer, mesh and statistics writers.
 */

/** @defgroup mesh Cell meshes
 *  Cells as closed triangulated surfaces: cell, node, edge and face.
 */

/** @defgroup cell_classes Cell classes
 *  The five cell classes selected by global_cell_id: epithelial, ECM, lumen, nucleus, static.
 */

/** @defgroup contact_models Contact models
 *  Contact models selected by CONTACT_MODEL_INDEX and the contact detection strategies.
 */

/** @defgroup time_integration Time integration
 *  Integration of the equations of motion selected by DYNAMIC_MODEL_INDEX.
 */

/** @defgroup triangulation Triangulation and division
 *  Local mesh refinement, cell division and initial triangulation.
 */

/** @defgroup polarization Polarization
 *  Polarization by discretisation of the simulation space (POLARIZATION_MODE_INDEX 2).
 */

/** @defgroup spatial_partitioning Spatial partitioning
 *  Uniform spatial partitioning grids and Morton codes.
 */

/** @defgroup math Mathematics
 *  Vectors, 3 x 3 matrices, quaternions and the symmetric eigensolver.
 */

/** @defgroup runtime Runtime support
 *  Thread placement, performance monitoring and utilities.
 */
